---
// Anatomy of Go's 16-byte iface (tab, data): why returning a typed nil pointer fails (err != nil is true).
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="gani">
  <div class="gani-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison of an untyped nil interface where both tab and data pointers are nil versus a typed nil pointer boxed inside an interface where tab points to *ValidationError and data is nil, making err != nil evaluate to true.">
      {/* Left: Untyped nil */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gani-card is-ok" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="gani-h-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Explicit return nil → truly nil interface</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Trả về return nil → interface thật sự nil</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="68" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gani-word" />
      <text x="46" y="92" class="gani-b">tab *itab</text>
      <text x="235" y="92" class="gani-ok">0x0 (nil)</text>
      <text x="46" y="114" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No concrete type descriptor stored</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không gắn mô tả kiểu dữ liệu cụ thể nào</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="138" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gani-word" />
      <text x="46" y="162" class="gani-b">data unsafe.Pointer</text>
      <text x="235" y="162" class="gani-ok">0x0 (nil)</text>
      <text x="46" y="184" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No concrete pointer value</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không có con trỏ giá trị nào</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="212" width="394" height="60" rx="6" class="gani-res is-ok" />
      <text x="227" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="gani-ok">err == nil → true</text>
      <text x="227" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Both words in runtime.iface are zero</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai trường trong runtime.iface đều bằng 0</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Typed nil */}
      <rect x="460" y="16" width="426" height="276" rx="10" class="gani-card is-red" />
      <text x="476" y="44" class="gani-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Return typed pointer var err *MyErr → trap!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Trả về biến con trỏ var err *MyErr → dính bẫy!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="68" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gani-word is-red" />
      <text x="492" y="92" class="gani-b-red">tab *itab</text>
      <text x="650" y="92" class="gani-b-red">&amp;itab(*MyErr, error)</text>
      <text x="492" y="114" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Non-zero! Boxes the concrete pointer type</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khác 0! Đã gắn mô tả kiểu *MyErr vào interface</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="138" width="394" height="58" rx="6" class="gani-word" />
      <text x="492" y="162" class="gani-b">data unsafe.Pointer</text>
      <text x="650" y="162" class="gani-m">0x0 (nil)</text>
      <text x="492" y="184" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pointer inside is nil, yet interface is not</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Con trỏ bên trong bằng nil, nhưng interface thì không</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="212" width="394" height="60" rx="6" class="gani-res is-red" />
      <text x="673" y="238" text-anchor="middle" class="gani-b-red">err != nil → true (false alarm!)</text>
      <text x="673" y="258" text-anchor="middle" class="gani-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Caller enters error branch; err.Error() may panic</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Caller nhảy vào nhánh lỗi; gọi err.Error() có thể panic</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A Go interface value holds two words: a type table pointer (tab) and a value pointer (data). An interface equals nil only when both words are zero.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Giá trị interface trong Go gồm hai word: con trỏ bảng kiểu (tab) và con trỏ dữ liệu (data). Interface chỉ bằng nil khi cả hai word cùng bằng 0.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gani { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gani-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gani svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gani text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gani-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gani-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gani-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gani-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gani-word { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gani-word.is-red { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .gani-res { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gani-res.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gani-res.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gani-res.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gani-h-ok { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gani-h-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gani-h-red { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gani-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gani-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gani-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gani-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gani-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gani-sm { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gani figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
